    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Step into a twisted 80s-inspired world full of dark secrets, haunted graveyards, and\u00a0 \u00a0supernatural threats. Travel trough the board and explore the different areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/68871977868c182af98cf32065bcf8e9.poster.avif?t=1751006060\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/68871977868c182af98cf32065bcf8e9.webm?t=1751006060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/68871977868c182af98cf32065bcf8e9.mp4?t=1751006060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/608730e04d4f437f47b874ba7b9addf6.webp?t=1751006060\" width=614 height=60 /></span>\u00a0Battle your way through the board. The tougher the foe, the better the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/a576fdff8f983239f44df6f032556942.webp?t=1751006060\" width=614 height=60 /></span>\u00a0Trick, trap, or take them down... but beware, they\u2019ll do the same to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/57fa208674e8c60021040c2082cb9905.webp?t=1751006060\" width=614 height=60 /></span>\u00a0Hunt down hidden crystals across the board. No crystals, no final fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/83ef4261e50a8b822b1afc37e654b36d.webp?t=1751006060\" width=614 height=60 /></span>\u00a0Only one can claim victory. Will you have the most crystals? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiplayer PVP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiplayer PVE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Boardgame aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Crossplay (IOS/Android/PC)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Horror satirical elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Turn-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Custom cards and boardgame </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skin customization </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tabletop vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamic optimization of game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > P2P hosting solution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In-game tutorial</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Step into a twisted 80s-inspired world full of dark secrets, haunted graveyards, and\u00a0 \u00a0supernatural threats. Travel trough the board and explore the different areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/68871977868c182af98cf32065bcf8e9.poster.avif?t=1751006060\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/68871977868c182af98cf32065bcf8e9.webm?t=1751006060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/68871977868c182af98cf32065bcf8e9.mp4?t=1751006060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/608730e04d4f437f47b874ba7b9addf6.webp?t=1751006060\" width=614 height=60 /></span>\u00a0Battle your way through the board. The tougher the foe, the better the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/a576fdff8f983239f44df6f032556942.webp?t=1751006060\" width=614 height=60 /></span>\u00a0Trick, trap, or take them down... but beware, they\u2019ll do the same to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/57fa208674e8c60021040c2082cb9905.webp?t=1751006060\" width=614 height=60 /></span>\u00a0Hunt down hidden crystals across the board. No crystals, no final fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/83ef4261e50a8b822b1afc37e654b36d.webp?t=1751006060\" width=614 height=60 /></span>\u00a0Only one can claim victory. Will you have the most crystals? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiplayer PVP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiplayer PVE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Boardgame aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Crossplay (IOS/Android/PC)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Horror satirical elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Turn-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Custom cards and boardgame </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skin customization </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tabletop vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamic optimization of game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > P2P hosting solution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In-game tutorial</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Board Game Society is a turn-based RPG soaked in 80s VHS horror vibes. Play as a misfit crew of teen archetypes \u2014 the goth, the jock, the nerd, and more \u2014 as you explore the cursed forest of Timber Falls. Roll the dice to fight monsters, collect loot, and race to defeat the Boss.",
